{"id":146,"flavor":[{"games":["Shield"],"text":"There are stories of this Pokémon using its radiant, flame-cloaked wings to light up paths for those lost in the mountains."},{"games":["Sword"],"text":"It’s one of the legendary bird Pokémon. When Moltres flaps its flaming wings, they glimmer with a dazzling red glow."},{"games":["Let’s Go, Eevee!","Let’s Go, Pikachu!","Yellow"],"text":"A legendary bird Pokémon. As it flaps its flaming wings, even the night sky will turn red."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Omega Ruby","Sapphire","Ruby"],"text":"Moltres is a legendary bird Pokémon that has the ability to control fire. If this Pokémon is injured, it is said to dip its body in the molten magma of a volcano to burn and heal itself."},{"games":["Y","White 2","Black 2","White","Black","Platinum","Pearl","Diamond"],"text":"One of the legendary bird Pokémon. It is said that its appearance indicates the coming of spring."},{"games":["X","LeafGreen"],"text":"It is said to be the legendary bird Pokémon of fire. Every flap of its wings creates a dazzling flare of flames."},{"games":["SoulSilver","Silver"],"text":"This legendary bird Pokémon is said to bring early spring to the wintry lands it visits."},{"games":["HeartGold","Gold"],"text":"This legendary Pokémon scatters embers with every flap of its wings. It is a thrilling sight to behold."},{"games":["FireRed"],"text":"One of the legendary bird POKéMON. Those seeing it are overwhelmed by its orange wings that seem to be on fire."},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"MOLTRES is a legendary bird POKéMON that can control fire. If injured, it is said to dip its body in the molten magma of a volcano to burn and heal itself."},{"games":["Crystal"],"text":"Legendary bird POKéMON. It is said to migrate from the south along with the spring."},{"games":["Blue","Red"],"text":"Known as the legendary bird of fire. Every flap of its wings creates a dazzling flash of flames."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Pressure","hidden":false,"description":"Puts other Pokémon under pressure, causing them to expend more PP to use their moves."},{"name":"Flame Body","hidden":true,"description":"Contact with the Pokémon may burn the attacker."}],"eggGroups":["Undiscovered"],"genderRate":-1,"hatchCounter":80,"baseHappiness":35,"growthRate":"slow","habitat":"rare","color":"Yellow","shape":"Wings","evolution":{"id":146,"name":"Moltres","condition":null,"children":[]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[1,16],[1,43],[5,52],[10,219],[15,17],[20,97],[25,246],[30,510],[35,403],[40,355],[45,257],[50,241],[55,542],[60,203],[65,315],[70,143]],"machine":[512,332,97,314,403,413,807,38,814,203,263,126,83,488,53,394,19,416,257,270,542,63,315,182,240,156,46,201,815,214,76,164,241,129,366,36,915,851,369,311,261],"egg":[],"tutor":[]},"cards":[{"id":"me55-130","name":"Moltres","set":"30th Celebration","date":"2026-09-16","rarity":"Illustration Rare","number":"130","artist":"mashu","small":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me55-130/small","large":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me55-130/large"},{"id":"me55-11","name":"Moltres","set":"30th Celebration","date":"2026-09-16","rarity":"Common","number":"11","artist":"HYOGONOSUKE","small":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me55-11/small","large":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me55-11/large"},{"id":"me2-14","name":"Moltres","set":"Phantasmal Flames","date":"2025-11-14","rarity":"Rare","number":"14","artist":"Kazumasa Yasukuni","img":"me2/14"},{"id":"sv10-31","name":"Team Rocket's Moltres ex","set":"Destined Rivals","date":"2025-05-30","rarity":"Double Rare","number":"31","artist":null,"img":"sv10/31"},{"id":"sv10-208","name":"Team Rocket's Moltres ex","set":"Destined Rivals","date":"2025-05-30","rarity":"Ultra Rare","number":"208","artist":null,"img":"sv10/208"},{"id":"sv10-229","name":"Team Rocket's Moltres ex","set":"Destined Rivals","date":"2025-05-30","rarity":"Special Illustration Rare","number":"229","artist":null,"img":"sv10/229"},{"id":"sv3pt5-146","name":"Moltres","set":"151","